    "detailed_description": "<h1>What's up with the &quot;CLASSIC&quot;?</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065330/extras/3384449827db83bec5c85391c2128017.poster.avif?t=1753576467\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065330/extras/3384449827db83bec5c85391c2128017.webm?t=1753576467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065330/extras/3384449827db83bec5c85391c2128017.mp4?t=1753576467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065330/extras/6e771126f9c376b52a7a3e6c09dde17d.poster.avif?t=1753576467\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065330/extras/6e771126f9c376b52a7a3e6c09dde17d.webm?t=1753576467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065330/extras/6e771126f9c376b52a7a3e6c09dde17d.mp4?t=1753576467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you sick and tired of janky, bug-riddled games? If so, I highly recommend you never return to this Steam page again. If the bugs don't bother you too much, then <strong>BUCKLE UP</strong>, because you are in for the ride of your life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Catto Pew Pew! CLASSIC</strong> is a chaotic physics-based arena shooter where your shots cause your opponent to fly backward. Smart movement, accuracy, and spam clicking are all seen throughout battles, where getting shot into the sunset is the norm. Best played with friends, Catto Pew Pew! CLASSIC is a fun, frenzied take on the Arena Shooter genre.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Shoot your friends and foes off into the sky using the power of stupid-fun </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Proximity Chat</strong> allows you to hear your opponent's rage-filled gamer screaming fade away into the skyline as you send them farther and farther away </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Duke it out with up to 16 players in one of the fourteen havoc-filled arenas available</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*7 Maps are available with the base game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gamemodes:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Free for All</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Constant action ensues as players constantly respawn </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chaos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Spawn with no shield, go flying! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Timed</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Player with the least amount of deaths by the end of the match wins </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scramble</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Try and run down your timer while preventing other players from running down theirs.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065330/extras/6e771126f9c376b52a7a3e6c09dde17d.poster.avif?t=1753576467\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065330/extras/6e771126f9c376b52a7a3e6c09dde17d.webm?t=1753576467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2065330/extras/6e771126f9c376b52a7a3e6c09dde17d.mp4?t=1753576467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you sick and tired of janky, bug-riddled games? If so, I highly recommend you never return to this Steam page again. If the bugs don't bother you too much, then <strong>BUCKLE UP</strong>, because you are in for the ride of your life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Catto Pew Pew! CLASSIC</strong> is a chaotic physics-based arena shooter where your shots cause your opponent to fly backward. Smart movement, accuracy, and spam clicking are all seen throughout battles, where getting shot into the sunset is the norm. Best played with friends, Catto Pew Pew! CLASSIC is a fun, frenzied take on the Arena Shooter genre.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Shoot your friends and foes off into the sky using the power of stupid-fun </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Proximity Chat</strong> allows you to hear your opponent's rage-filled gamer screaming fade away into the skyline as you send them farther and farther away </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Duke it out with up to 16 players in one of the fourteen havoc-filled arenas available</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*7 Maps are available with the base game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gamemodes:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Free for All</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Constant action ensues as players constantly respawn </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chaos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Spawn with no shield, go flying! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Timed</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Player with the least amount of deaths by the end of the match wins </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scramble</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Try and run down your timer while preventing other players from running down theirs.</p>",
